  "caller_evidence": [
    "SortExec::fetch_and_sort has no parallel dispatch at baseline; Next always invokes it.",
    "The only production caller of ParallelSortSpillHelper is the disconnected fetch_and_sort_parallel.",
    "The only production caller of MultiWayMerger is the retired helper. Active Sort and TopN use their own retained result heaps.",
    "DataCursor/reload_cursor and RowWithPartition are private to the removed generic merger; message/status/admission adapters have no other production consumer.",
    "SortExec::with_parallelism only wrote a field read by disconnected code; physical builder now constructs the active owner directly. TopN concurrency is unchanged.",
    "worker_pool::spawned_so_far is used only by the removed source-shape worker-count test; shared pool and panic boundaries are retained."
  ],
